    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Inspired by multiplayer classics, Paramount Hero is a third-person skill-progression MMO with a fantasy world setting.  Kill mobs, collect loot, hone your skills, complete quests, and cooperate with (or kill!) other players to become a legendary hero.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50+ varieties of monsters including unique rare-spawns<br></li><li> 20+ quests - and not of the &quot;kill X monsters&quot; variety<br></li><li> Dozens of skills and spells<br></li><li> Hundreds of items to collect and craft<br></li><li> Day/night cycles<br></li><li> Dynamically changing weather<br></li><li> Summonable pets who will fight for you<br></li><li> Interactive and branching quest NPC dialog<br></li><li> 3km\u00b2 main world area, procedurally generated content with hand-crafted points of interest<br></li><li> Real-time multi-shard online multiplayer<br></li><li> Support for hundreds of players per shard<br></li><li> In-game proximity/global chat<br></li><li> Situation-based NPC AI<br></li><li> Fully server-authoritative / cheat-resistant</li></ul>",
